msgid "OPENING_SKIP"
msgstr "Skip opening"

msgid "OPENING_NPC_INVITE"
msgstr "If you're going after gold, count me in. I'll keep an eye on Tortuga in the meantime."

msgid "OPENING_TOAST"
msgstr "The cups meet in the middle of the table. Nobody here trusts anybody — but gold is a fine reason to start. A mercenary company is born."

msgid "OPENING_DRUNK_CALL"
msgstr "From the corner, an old drunk raises his empty mug: \"Hey, mercenaries! If you're looking for treasure, you're standing on one!\" Talk to him."

msgid "OPENING_SCENE_KNIGHT_MALE"
msgstr "{name} is slumped over the bar, surrounded by empty cups. Outside, a black horse waits, tied up."

msgid "OPENING_KNIGHT_MALE_1"
msgstr "I was the best at the Royal Military Academy. I got Corvo on graduation day and a place in the castle guard."

msgid "OPENING_KNIGHT_MALE_2"
msgstr "There I met the princess. The king didn't see a hero: he saw a soldier with no land and no gold. He banished me from the city."

msgid "OPENING_KNIGHT_MALE_3"
msgstr "I sold the armor, the sword and the medals. Not Corvo, though. If gold is what the king wants, I'll go get it."

msgid "OPENING_SCENE_KNIGHT_FEMALE"
msgstr "{name} complains to the barkeep about the wine, as if still at a banquet. Outside, a white horse waits."

msgid "OPENING_KNIGHT_FEMALE_1"
msgstr "I grew up in a castle. While the ladies embroidered, I trained with the soldiers and rode better than anyone in the stables."

msgid "OPENING_KNIGHT_FEMALE_2"
msgstr "One day they found out I wasn't the king's true daughter. I lost the title, the throne and the family. I fled at night, riding Aurora."

msgid "OPENING_KNIGHT_FEMALE_3"
msgstr "I will not stay poor. If the demons guard the kingdom's gold, it will pay for the life I deserve."

msgid "OPENING_SCENE_NINJA_MALE"
msgstr "{name} walks past a table and, by the time its owner notices, the coin purse has already changed hands."

msgid "OPENING_NINJA_MALE_1"
msgstr "My father is a famous samurai. Before I learned to read, I already knew a thousand ways to kill."

msgid "OPENING_NINJA_MALE_2"
msgstr "I was the fastest in the clan, but discipline was never my thing. One day I left without looking back."

msgid "OPENING_NINJA_MALE_3"
msgstr "Here in Tortuga I steal purses. A treasure guarded by demons? That's the biggest heist of my life."

msgid "OPENING_SCENE_NINJA_FEMALE"
msgstr "{name} spins a coin between their fingers — a coin that, a minute ago, was in a pirate's pocket."

msgid "OPENING_NINJA_FEMALE_1"
msgstr "In the Kurogane clan, women don't fight. I learned in secret, before dawn, watching my brothers train."

msgid "OPENING_NINJA_FEMALE_2"
msgstr "My father chose who I would marry. I chose the door."

msgid "OPENING_NINJA_FEMALE_3"
msgstr "Now I steal to live. And a demon's treasure is worth more than every purse in Tortuga put together."

msgid "OPENING_SCENE_ARCHER"
msgstr "At a corner table, {name} eats in silence, back to the wall and bow within reach."

msgid "OPENING_ARCHER_1"
msgstr "In my childhood, hunger ruled our house. I learned to hunt to feed my family, in the forest they now call the Dark Forest."

msgid "OPENING_ARCHER_2"
msgstr "Then came the war. My kingdom lost, my village burned, and I was left with no one."

msgid "OPENING_ARCHER_3"
msgstr "Hunting is all I know. So I hunt for gold. They say part of my kingdom's treasure is with the demons... I want to see that up close."

msgid "OPENING_SCENE_MAGE"
msgstr "{name} writes in a worn notebook. The candle on the table lit itself when the door slammed."

msgid "OPENING_MAGE_1"
msgstr "Since childhood, strange things happen around me. Candles light, water freezes, the wind opens windows."

msgid "OPENING_MAGE_2"
msgstr "It took me years to control one of the elements. The others still answer, but they don't obey me."

msgid "OPENING_MAGE_3"
msgstr "Every answer brings more questions. And the greatest secrets of magic lie in the demons' treasures."

msgid "OPENING_SCENE_SUMMONER"
msgstr "A bird lands on {name}'s shoulder and gets a share of the bread, while {name} keeps watching the door."

msgid "OPENING_SUMMONER_1"
msgstr "Since childhood, animals come to me. Even the ones everyone fears."

msgid "OPENING_SUMMONER_2"
msgstr "Many of my friends are orphans. The corrupted creatures killed their families."

msgid "OPENING_SUMMONER_3"
msgstr "So I fight them. If the road goes through gold and mercenaries, so be it."


