msgid "LEGENDARY_ROYAL_COUNCILOR_STAFF_LORE"
msgstr "From the royal armory of the kingdom that lost the war. It still holds the warmth of the king's counselor."

msgid "LEGENDARY_ROYAL_GUARD_BOW"
msgstr "Royal Guard Bow"

msgid "LEGENDARY_ROYAL_GUARD_BOW_LORE"
msgstr "The eagle over three arrows is still carved on the grip. The guard fell; the bow did not."

msgid "LEGENDARY_STANDARD_BEARER_LANCE"
msgstr "Standard-Bearer's Lance"

msgid "LEGENDARY_STANDARD_BEARER_LANCE_LORE"
msgstr "It carried the kingdom's banner to the last battle. A scrap of the cloth is still tied to it."

msgid "LEGENDARY_TREASURER_DAGGERS"
msgstr "Treasurer's Daggers"

msgid "LEGENDARY_TREASURER_DAGGERS_LORE"
msgstr "The king's treasurer guarded the gold with these. Irony: now they serve a thief."

msgid "LEGENDARY_ROYAL_STABLES_BOOK"
msgstr "Book of the Royal Stables"

msgid "LEGENDARY_ROYAL_STABLES_BOOK_LORE"
msgstr "The name of every one of the king's animals, written by hand. The animals still answer when the book opens."

