msgstr "The Fallen King's Heart"

msgid "QUEST_ROYAL_HEART_DESC"
msgstr "The Capital's Priest wants to lay Veldmark's last king to rest. The Crypt Lord, in the Cemetery, keeps his heart: defeat him and bring the Human Heart to the Priest."

msgid "QUEST_ROYAL_SKULL"
msgstr "The Fallen King's Skull"

msgid "QUEST_ROYAL_SKULL_DESC"
msgstr "The Fort Commander carries the skull of Veldmark's last king. Defeat him and hand the Old Skull to the Priest."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_HEART_1"
msgstr "You have walked the lands of Veldmark, haven't you? There, the last king of the defeated realm was dug up: Lucifer's demons took the body piece by piece."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_HEART_2"
msgstr "I fought him in life, but no man deserves that. The Crypt Lord keeps his heart in the Cemetery. Bring me the heart and the Church pays in gold."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_HEART_ACTIVE"
msgstr "Bring the Human Heart the Crypt Lord keeps in the Cemetery. When you have it, just hand it over."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_SKULL_1"
msgstr "The heart and the lungs now rest. The skull is missing: the cursed Commander of the Fort carries it as a trophy for Lucifer."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_SKULL_2"
msgstr "Bring the Old Skull and the king will have a whole grave. The Church pays well for it."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_SKULL_ACTIVE"
msgstr "The Old Skull is with the Fort Commander. Hand it to me when you have it."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_DONE"
msgstr "Veldmark's king rests, whole, thanks to you. May the light guide your steps, mercenaries."

msgid "DLG_SERVICE_TURN_IN"
msgstr "Hand over the relic"

msgid "TOAST_NEED_QUEST_ITEM"
msgstr "Missing: {item}"

msgid "MONSTER_FROG_KING"
msgstr "Frog King"

msgid "MONSTER_VIPER_QUEEN"
msgstr "Viper Queen"

msgid "MONSTER_RUIN_ALPHA"
msgstr "Pack Alpha"

msgid "MONSTER_SUCCUBUS_QUEEN"
msgstr "Succubus Queen"

msgid "MONSTER_TROLL_CHIEF"
msgstr "Troll Chief"

msgid "NPC_COURT_JESTER"
msgstr "Court Jester"

msgid "DLG_JESTER_1"
msgstr "Ah, the famous mercenaries of Tortuga! What an honor, what an honor…"

msgid "DLG_JESTER_2"
msgstr "(lowering his voice) Nobody pays attention to a fool — which is why I hear everything."

msgid "DLG_JESTER_3"
msgstr "The king's gold is vanishing from the vaults, and nobody in the castle notices. Come back when you're ready: I know where to look."

msgid "ARENA_BUNKER"
msgstr "Bunker"

msgid "PROP_TO_BUNKER"
msgstr "Bunker Hatch"

msgid "PROP_RETURN_FARM"
msgstr "Back to the Farm"

msgid "VALUABLE_WILD_MEAT"
msgstr "Wild Meat"

msgid "QUEST_ROYAL_BANQUET"
msgstr "The King's Banquet"

msgid "QUEST_ROYAL_BANQUET_DESC"
msgstr "The Court Jester wants meat on the king's table. The Pack Alpha, in the Ruins, has the best: defeat him and bring the Wild Meat to the Jester."

msgid "DLG_JESTER_BANQUET_1"
msgstr "Look at this table: apples, bananas… and not a piece of meat! The king is so distracted by the gold vanishing from the vaults that he forgot to eat like a king."

msgid "DLG_JESTER_BANQUET_2"
msgstr "The Pack Alpha, in the Ruins, has the most famous meat in the realm. Bring it and I will tell you what I know, fool to mercenary."

msgid "DLG_JESTER_BANQUET_ACTIVE"
msgstr "The Wild Meat is with the Pack Alpha, in the Ruins. The king's table is waiting, and so am I!"

msgid "DLG_JESTER_BANQUET_DONE"
msgstr "What a feast, what a feast! The king ate like never before. You have a friend in the castle."

msgid "MONSTER_LUCIFER"
msgstr "Lucifer"

msgid "NPC_RUINS_SPARTAN"
msgstr "Leonidas, the Veteran"

msgid "DLG_SPARTAN_1"
msgstr "Halt, strangers. I am Leonidas. I have held this entrance since the war brought down the walls, and nobody passes without telling me why."

msgid "DLG_SPARTAN_2"
msgstr "The goblins came after the fire, like rats after scraps. They roam in two packs: one in the eastern streets and one deep in the city, near the vault."

msgid "DLG_SPARTAN_3"
msgstr "They are quick and frail, but they come in numbers. They are creatures of the earth — Fire brings them down. Clear the streets and I will pay in gold."

msgid "DLG_SPARTAN_ACTIVE"
msgstr "The goblins still roam the streets: one pack to the east, another near the vault. Stay together and use Fire."

msgid "DLG_SPARTAN_DONE"
msgstr "Quiet in the streets for the first time in years. You have an old soldier's thanks. May the gods guard your shields."

msgid "QUEST_RUINS_GOBLINS"
msgstr "Goblin Plague"

msgid "QUEST_RUINS_GOBLINS_DESC"
msgstr "Leonidas, the Veteran, asks you to defeat the two goblin packs infesting the streets of the Ruins. They are Earth — they fear Fire."

msgid "PROP_BASKET"
msgstr "Basket"

msgid "NPC_FOREST_HERMIT"
msgstr "Hermit of the Stone"

msgid "NPC_FOREST_PYRE_KEEPER"
msgstr "Keeper of the Pyre"

msgid "DLG_HERMIT_1"
msgstr "I have kept this square for decades. The stones tell me everything, and today they speak of you: strangers itching for a fight."

msgid "DLG_HERMIT_2"
msgstr "Beneath these flagstones sleeps the Stone Golem, the old warden of the woods. He wakes only when someone asks, and I know the way to ask."

msgid "DLG_HERMIT_3"
msgstr "Step back to the edge of the square… I call him now. He is of Earth — he fears Fire."

msgid "DLG_PYRE_1"
msgstr "The pyre never dies, strangers. I have fed it since the Forest was truly green."

msgid "DLG_PYRE_2"
msgstr "In the heart of the embers sleeps the Fire Golem. He listens when I sing, and sings back with fists of lava."

msgid "DLG_PYRE_3"
msgstr "If you want to face him, get ready: the embers are already stirring…"

msgid "TOAST_HERMIT_AWAKENS"
msgstr "The ground splits: the Stone Golem awakens!"

msgid "TOAST_PYRE_AWAKENS"
msgstr "The embers roar: the Fire Golem awakens!"

msgid "PROP_MINIBOSS_CHEST"
msgstr "Mini-boss chest"

msgid "TOAST_MINIBOSS_CHEST"
msgstr "The mini-boss left a chest!"

msgid "MONSTER_DARK_ELF_LORD"
msgstr "Dark Elf Lord"

msgid "NPC_FORT_PENITENT"
msgstr "The Penitent"

msgid "DLG_PENITENT_1"
msgstr "I served the Queen of Succubi once. Now I kneel in this corridor and pay for it."

msgid "DLG_PENITENT_2"
msgstr "She sleeps in the hall beyond that arch, and she will not wake unless someone calls her by name. I know it."

msgid "DLG_PENITENT_3"
msgstr "Step back… I call her now. Fire is her blood: bring water, or bring luck."

msgid "TOAST_PENITENT_AWAKENS"
msgstr "The arch glows: the Succubus Queen awakens!"

msgid "NPC_FORT_EXILE"
msgstr "The Exile"

msgid "DLG_EXILE_1"
msgstr "They cast me out for questioning the Commander. I have waited in this corridor ever since."

msgid "DLG_EXILE_2"
msgstr "Beyond lies the Dark Elf Lord, captain of the crossbowmen. He keeps the south road and never lets anyone pass."

msgid "DLG_EXILE_3"
msgstr "Keep moving while he reloads, and let nothing get between you and the Commander's door. I will wake him for you."

msgid "TOAST_EXILE_AWAKENS"
msgstr "A horn sounds: the Dark Elf Lord awakens!"

msgid "QUEST_FOREST_STONE"
msgstr "The Stone Warden"

msgid "QUEST_FOREST_STONE_DESC"
msgstr "The Hermit of the Stone asks you to defeat the Stone Golem he awakens in the square. It is of Earth — it fears Fire."

msgid "QUEST_FOREST_FIRE"
msgstr "The Heart of the Pyre"

msgid "QUEST_FOREST_FIRE_DESC"
msgstr "The Keeper of the Pyre asks you to defeat the Fire Golem she awakens from the embers of the square."

msgid "DLG_HERMIT_ACTIVE"
msgstr "The old warden still walks. Bring him down, strangers."

msgid "DLG_HERMIT_DONE"
msgstr "The stone sleeps again. Take your reward; the stones are grateful."

msgid "DLG_PYRE_ACTIVE"
msgstr "The embers still roar. Put an end to him, strangers."

msgid "DLG_PYRE_DONE"
msgstr "The pyre burns gently again. Take what I owe you."

msgid "VALUABLE_HUMAN_LUNGS"
msgstr "Human Lungs"

msgid "QUEST_ROYAL_LUNGS"
msgstr "The Fallen King's Lungs"

msgid "QUEST_ROYAL_LUNGS_DESC"
msgstr "The Crypt Ogre, in the Cemetery, keeps the lungs of Veldmark's last king: defeat him and bring the Human Lungs to the Priest."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_LUNGS_1"
msgstr "The heart now rests, but the king still does not breathe in peace: the lungs ended up with the Crypt Ogre, in the same Cemetery."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_LUNGS_2"
msgstr "He is big and brutish, but only guards what he was told to. Bring the lungs and the Church pays again."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_LUNGS_ACTIVE"
msgstr "The Human Lungs are with the Crypt Ogre, in the Cemetery. Hand them to me when you have them."

msgid "VALUABLE_ROYAL_SOUL"
msgstr "King's Soul"

msgid "QUEST_ROYAL_SOUL"
msgstr "The Fallen King's Soul"

msgid "QUEST_ROYAL_SOUL_DESC"
msgstr "The Tomb Guardian has trapped the soul of Veldmark's last king. Defeat him, in the Mine or the Cemetery, and bring the King's Soul to the Priest."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_SOUL_1"
msgstr "The body is whole, but the king still does not rest: his soul, a little ghost that laughs at its own bad luck, was trapped by the Tomb Guardian."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_SOUL_2"
msgstr "He wanders between the Mine and the Cemetery, where the statue wakes him. Bring the soul and the Church pays its last fee."

msgid "DLG_PRIEST_SOUL_ACTIVE"
msgstr "The King's Soul is with the Tomb Guardian, in the Mine or the Cemetery. Hand it to me when you have it."

msgid "ARENA_DESERT"
msgstr "Desert — Canyon"

msgid "PROP_TO_DESERT"
msgstr "Path to the Desert"

msgid "MONSTER_SAND_LAMASSU"
msgstr "Sand Lamassu"

msgid "MONSTER_QUEEN_SCORPION"
msgstr "Scorpion Queen"

msgid "NPC_SEATED_PIRATE"
msgstr "Pirate Captain"

msgid "DLG_PIRATE_1"
msgstr "Sit down, mercenary. See that pier out there, at the Docks? It used to be mine: now it's just frogs, bats and ugly anglerfish."

msgid "DLG_PIRATE_2"
msgstr "My ship docks there and I can't unload a barrel without losing a finger. Clear the pier for me."

msgid "DLG_PIRATE_3"
msgstr "Kill every critter on the Docks: frogs, ugly frogs, bats and the anglerfish. I pay in gold and rum… more in gold."

msgid "DLG_PIRATE_ACTIVE"
msgstr "There are still critters on the pier. Come back when the last one is floating."

msgid "DLG_PIRATE_DONE"
msgstr "The pier is clean! A toast to the mercenary who is not afraid to get their feet wet."

msgid "QUEST_DOCKS_SMUGGLERS"
msgstr "The Old Sea Wolf's Pier"

msgid "QUEST_DOCKS_SMUGGLERS_DESC"
msgstr "The Old Sea Wolf, in the tavern, wants the Docks pier free of critters: defeat every encounter on the Docks map."

msgid "NPC_OLD_LADY"
msgstr "Tavern Old Lady"

msgid "DLG_OLD_LADY_1"
msgstr "Sit, sit. This old woman has seen many people walk through that door, and few return from the woods."

msgid "DLG_OLD_LADY_2"
msgstr "The Leshy lives in the Forest, a giant of bark and stone. He is Earth — Fire is what the old bark fears."

msgid "DLG_OLD_LADY_3"
msgstr "Bring him down and I will reward you. The ranger Aeliana waits on the trail."

msgid "DLG_OLD_LADY_ACTIVE"
msgstr "The Leshy sleeps deep in the woods. Take Fire with you, dears."

msgid "DLG_OLD_LADY_DONE"
msgstr "So the woods breathe again. How good to have you around."
